        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-much-more-does-it-cost-to-create-an-ai-crawlable-website-compared-to-a-norma",
        "name": "How much more does it cost to create an AI-crawlable website compared to a normal small business site?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
