              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "In markets like Los Angeles and Austin, per-page JSON-LD can still be an advantage if competitors have incomplete or generic schema. It helps your listings stand out with rich results and clearer local signals, but it works best alongside strong content, links, and UX—not as a standalone tactic."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "In markets like Los Angeles and Austin, per-page JSON-LD can still be an advantage if competitors have incomplete or generic schema. It helps your listings stan"
      }
    },
