        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "Does AEO software actually help a local business in Los Angeles or San Diego, or is it just for big national brands?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "For a local business in Los Angeles or San Diego, AEO software helps your brand show up in AI responses to nearby, question-based searches like “who’s the best X near me?” or “where can I get Y today?”. It complements local SEO by focusing on how AI tools describe and recommend you.\n\nIt’s especially useful as more people ask conversational questions via mobile, voice, and chat, expecting a single recommended provider rather than a long list of links.\n\nKey factors:\n- Strong Google Business Profile with reviews and clear services\n- Local business schema, opening hours, and service areas\n- Content that explicitly answers local questions and use cases\n- Monitoring how AI tools describe your business vs competitors\n\nUse AEO software to identify question gaps (parking, appointment times, same-day options, neighborhoods served) and add precise answers across your site and profiles. Track whether AI tools start citing your brand for those questions.\n\nLocal businesses in LA/SD that already invest in reviews and clear information will see the biggest lift from layering AEO on top.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "AEO software can strongly benefit local businesses in Los Angeles and San Diego by improving how AI tools, voice assistants, and snippets recommend you for question-based searches like “best X near me.” It builds on local SEO with clearer answers, local schema, and review-driven authority."
