              "description": "Begin by listing your top customer questions and testing them in tools like ChatGPT, Gemini, and Perplexity to see if your brand appears. Fix obvious technical issues (speed, crawlability, missing schema) on your main pages, then rewrite content so it answers those questions directly in the first 100–150 words."
            }
