        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/when-is-it-worth-hiring-someone-to-handle-structured-data-generation-instead-of",
        "name": "When is it worth hiring someone to handle structured data generation instead of trying to do it myself?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
