            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "No, there’s no guarantee that making your site AI-crawlable will instantly increase leads or sales, but it significantly raises the chances that AI systems present accurate, persuasive information about you. The commercial impact comes from better visibility and trust in those AI answers.\n\nTreat it as infrastructure for demand capture, not a quick growth hack.\n\n**Key factors:**\n- How often your prospects use AI assistants for research in your space\n- Whether AI answers currently include or exclude your brand\n- Quality and clarity of your on‑site messaging once AI users arrive\n- Complementary channels (SEO, ads, email) that turn visits into revenue\n\nMeasure success by better placement and accuracy in AI responses, and then by downstream metrics like conversions from organic and AI‑driven traffic. In competitive cities like Los Angeles or Austin, this can be a differentiator when prospects compare multiple providers via AI.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "AI crawlability doesn’t guarantee more leads by itself, but it makes it far more likely that AI assistants show accurate, compelling information about your business. That visibility, combined with strong on‑site messaging and conversion paths, can translate into more qualified inquiries and sales."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "AI crawlability doesn’t guarantee more leads by itself, but it makes it far more likely that AI assistants show accurate, compelling information about your busi"
      }
