        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/is-it-still-reasonable-to-hand-code-json-ld-per-page-or-do-i-really-need-a-gener",
        "name": "Is it still reasonable to hand-code JSON-LD per page, or do I really need a generator or automation?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
