            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Mobile experience is critical because most voice searches happen on phones, and slow or clumsy sites are less likely to be surfaced as answers.\n\nAEO assumes your site is mobile-ready before you chase more advanced tactics.\n\n**Key factors**\n- Pass Core Web Vitals on mobile (speed, responsiveness, stability).\n- Use responsive design and readable typography for small screens.\n- Remove intrusive pop-ups or heavy scripts that block content.\n- Ensure HTTPS and clean, crawlable markup.\n\nAudit your site with common mobile tools, then fix speed and usability issues alongside content and schema work.\n\nConsider mobile optimization a prerequisite—voice assistants don’t want to send users to pages that perform poorly on their primary device.",
