            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "If you’re in Denver and seeing competitors in AI overviews or featured snippets, you can use that data to guide your AEO strategy.\n\nThe goal is to understand why their answers are winning and match or surpass them.\n\n**Key factors**\n- Analyze competitor snippets for length, structure, and clarity.\n- Note whether they use lists, tables, or short paragraphs for answers.\n- Check how they reference Denver or local context in their content.\n- Identify questions where you’re close in ranking but not yet the snippet.\n\nPrioritize rewriting those near-miss pages with stronger direct answers, relevant local references, and matching formats for the query type.\n\nThink of competitors’ voice and AI visibility as a roadmap for where your AEO efforts can pay off fastest.",
