        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-important-are-best-cheapest-and-similar-intent-words-in-voice-search-keyword",
        "name": "How important are “best,” “cheapest,” and similar intent words in voice search keywords?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
