        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-if-i-invest-in-voice-search-keywords-and-don-t-see-results-for-months-what",
        "name": "What if I invest in voice search keywords and don’t see results for months—what should I troubleshoot?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
