        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/is-voice-assistant-optimization-going-to-be-crazy-expensive-or-is-there-a-realis",
        "name": "Is voice assistant optimization going to be crazy expensive, or is there a realistic budget range for a small business that just wants to show up more in Siri/Google answers?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
            ".faq-question",
