        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-do-i-actually-know-if-voice-assistant-optimization-is-working-beyond-guessin",
        "name": "How do I actually know if voice assistant optimization is working, beyond guessing? What should I be measuring?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
