        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-if-i-invest-in-voice-assistant-optimization-and-don-t-see-any-changes-for-m",
        "name": "What if I invest in voice assistant optimization and don’t see any changes for months—how do I troubleshoot that without wasting more money?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
