      "item": {
        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/i-m-worried-voice-assistant-optimization-will-force-me-to-oversimplify-complex-t",
        "name": "I’m worried voice assistant optimization will force me to oversimplify complex topics. Do I have to dumb down all my content for voice?",
