        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "How can I tell whether the problem is my voice, my mic, or Siri itself?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Yes, especially if Siri is constantly mishearing you. Try retraining voice recognition, checking microphone cleanliness, and speaking at a steady pace in a quieter environment. If the problem only happens in one room or while driving, the environment may be the bigger issue.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "Test in a quiet place, clean the mic, and retrain voice recognition. If Siri improves, the issue was likely environmental or hardware-related."
