        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-does-alexa-optimization-usually-cost-and-how-do-i-know-if-it-s-worth-it-for",
        "name": "What does Alexa optimization usually cost, and how do I know if it’s worth it for my business?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
