              "description": "Alexa doesn’t have a separate approval portal for local listings. You become “eligible” by having verified, consistent business profiles on the main directories Alexa uses (Google, Yelp, Bing Places, Apple Maps) and by looking like a real, trustworthy business with accurate data and reviews."
