        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-long-does-it-realistically-take-to-see-results-from-optimizing-for-google-as",
        "name": "How long does it realistically take to see results from optimizing for Google Assistant voice answers?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
