        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/can-a-slow-website-keep-me-from-ranking-in-voice-search-even-if-my-seo-is-good",
        "name": "Can a slow website keep me from ranking in voice search even if my SEO is good?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
