              "description": "Yes. Voice search ranking factors favor long-tail, natural language, question-based keywords over short, rigid phrases. Shifting your strategy to target “who/what/where/when/why/how” queries and conversational modifiers like “near me” helps your content align with real spoken searches and rank better in voice results."
