            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Spoken search supports natural language, so you can ask follow-ups like “What about vegetarian options?” after a restaurant query.\nMany assistants track conversational context for a short window.\n\n**Key factors:**\n- Whether your assistant supports multi-turn conversations\n- How clearly follow-up questions reference the prior topic\n- Time elapsed since the previous query\n- Device settings for conversational mode\n\nIn practice, ask your main question, listen fully, then make one focused follow-up such as “Sort by highest rating” or “Show only kid-friendly options.”\nIf the assistant loses context, re-state the core topic out loud instead of relying on it to remember.",
              "@type": "Answer",
