              "description": "Start AEO by listing your audience’s top questions, turning each into an answer-first section, then adding FAQ or HowTo schema. Begin with 10–20 high-impact questions, rewrite content into concise Q&A blocks, implement JSON-LD schema, and test whether AI tools start citing your site."
