              "description": "For fast results, don’t rebuild—update your existing high-traffic pages. Add question-style headings based on real queries, place 40–60 word direct answers under each, implement FAQ schema, and fix obvious mobile speed issues. Target 10–20 high-value questions tied to core services for the quickest impact."
            }
