              "description": "To show up in “near me” voice searches, first fully optimize and sync your Google Business Profile, Apple, Bing, and Yelp listings, then add conversational FAQ content and schema on your site and build consistent reviews. Voice assistants rely on accurate, structured local data plus natural‑language answers, so clean profiles and spoken‑style content are critical."
