              "description": "It’s realistic, but you have to earn it. Small sites can win featured snippets by targeting narrow, long-tail questions, ranking on page 1, and offering the clearest 40–60 word answers with strong structure and schema. You likely won’t win broad terms, but you can own specific voice-search niches."
