        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/are-there-any-real-risks-to-chasing-featured-snippets-for-voice-search-or-is-it",
        "name": "Are there any real risks to chasing featured snippets for voice search, or is it basically harmless if I get things wrong?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
