        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "How do I measure whether my investment in featured snippets for voice search is actually paying off in real business terms?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "To measure ROI, you need to track how snippet-focused pages influence **visibility, engagement, and downstream conversions**, not just raw traffic.\n\nVoice search often contributes indirectly by building trust and intent.\n\n**Key factors:**\n- Monitor featured snippet appearances and rich results in Search Console\n- Track organic clicks and behavior on snippet-driven landing pages\n- Attribute assisted conversions from those pages in your analytics\n- Compare performance against similar non-optimized pages\n\nSet up dashboards that show query-level snippet status, page-level engagement, and conversion paths involving snippet-ready content. Look for lift in high-intent queries and reduction in “how” or “what” support requests.\n\nThinking in terms of influence on the customer journey reveals the true value of voice-search snippets.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "Track featured snippet presence, organic clicks, and user behavior on snippet-optimized pages, then tie those pages to assisted conversions in your analytics. Compare against similar non-optimized content. The ROI comes from increased visibility, better engagement, and more users progressing toward valuable actions."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Track featured snippet presence, organic clicks, and user behavior on snippet-optimized pages, then tie those pages to assisted conversions in your analytics. C"
      }
    },
