              "description": "Speakable schema is still a valid Schema.org property and remains in Google’s beta program, primarily for U.S. news and article content. It has not been deprecated, but its official scope is narrow, so you should see it as a focused, future‑oriented enhancement rather than a mainstream SEO feature."
