              "text": "The fastest measurable impact is usually on **direction requests, phone calls, and “near me” visibility** rather than raw website traffic. Voice assistants often give a single spoken answer or map listing, so you feel the change in call and visit behavior.\n\nOwners sometimes expect huge traffic spikes, but the real benefit is being the business the assistant chooses when a local customer wants something now. That shows up as more calls, messages, bookings and navigation taps.\n\nKey factors:\n- Increases in “call” and “directions” actions from your Business Profile\n- Higher visibility for “Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) software near me” type searches\n- Better conversion rates from local queries\n- Review growth and improved average rating over time\n\nPractically, watch your Google Business insights, call tracking numbers, and booking logs. Compare 90‑day periods before and after optimization to see changes in real customer actions, not just impressions.\n\nThink of voice search as a conversion lever: it helps ready‑to‑buy customers choose you faster.",
