              "description": "Yes. In San Diego, optimize for tourists and neighborhood-based searches by clearly describing nearby attractions, beaches or districts, keeping seasonal hours accurate, and using photos and reviews that show why you’re a good choice for visitors and locals who rely on Siri or Google for “near me” decisions."
