              "description": "They’re closely linked, so you shouldn’t treat them as either-or. Mobile SEO focuses on speed and usability, while voice adds conversational, question-based content and strong local profiles. Improve mobile speed and layout, then layer in voice-focused content, schema, and review work to strengthen both at once."
