              "description": "If you’re not mentioned after a few months, audit how assistants currently answer those questions, tighten your Q&A to match real phrasing, validate your schema markup, and strengthen reviews and third‑party citations. Use the results as feedback and iterate until your signals match what AI systems prefer."
