              "description": "You don’t need custom Alexa or Google Assistant skills for local voice visibility. Assistants mainly rely on your Google/Apple listings, website content, schema, and reviews. For most contractors, optimizing these basics delivers far more value than building a custom skill."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "You don’t need custom Alexa or Google Assistant skills for local voice visibility. Assistants mainly rely on your Google/Apple listings, website content, schema"
      }
