              "text": "DIY voice search optimization is realistic for many contractors, especially if you’re comfortable updating your own website and listings. The critical steps involve clear data entry and simple content, not advanced coding.\n\nHowever, complex schema or multi‑location setups may benefit from professional help.\n\nKey factors:\n- Listings, basic FAQs, and mobile performance are very accessible DIY tasks.\n- Schema can often be added via plugins or generators without deep technical skills.\n- Multi‑city, multi‑trade businesses require more structured strategy.\n- Time and consistency matter more than expertise for many steps.\n\nTry handling the essentials yourself first; if you hit a wall on schema or analytics, bring in a specialist for those pieces only.\n\nA hybrid approach keeps costs down while ensuring your technical foundation is sound.",
