        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-exactly-is-an-aeo-strategy-and-why-does-it-matter-for-my-business-now",
        "name": "What exactly is an AEO strategy, and why does it matter for my business now?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
