        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "What exactly is an AEO strategy, and why does it matter for my business now?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "An effective AEO strategy is a structured plan to help your content become the “go‑to answer” for AI Overviews, voice assistants, and answer boxes, not just traditional search results. It focuses on questions, concise answers, schema markup, and credibility signals so answer engines can confidently surface your brand.\n\nAEO matters because AI systems increasingly summarize the web for users instead of sending them to multiple links, meaning only a few sources get visibility and clicks. A solid strategy improves the odds your content is chosen as that trusted source.\n\nKey factors:\n- Question‑first content structure aligned to real user intent\n- Direct, self‑contained answers in the first 1–2 sentences\n- Schema markup (FAQPage, HowTo, Article, Organization, LocalBusiness)\n- Strong authority signals: expertise, reviews, and external mentions\n\nPractically, start by listing the top 50–100 questions buyers ask, auditing which pages already answer them, and reformatting those answers for clarity and structured data. Then, expand coverage around high‑value topics where AI Overviews already show up.\n\nHandled well, AEO strategy becomes a reusable system: every new page you create is designed to win answers, not just rankings.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "An AEO strategy is a plan to make your content the preferred answer for AI Overviews, voice assistants, and answer boxes, not just traditional search. It matters because AI systems are increasingly summarizing the web from a handful of trusted sources, and AEO increases your chances of being one of them."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "An AEO strategy is a plan to make your content the preferred answer for AI Overviews, voice assistants, and answer boxes, not just traditional search. It matter"
      }
