            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "You should consider hiring professional help for AEO strategy if you have complex products, multiple locations (like Los Angeles, San Diego, Austin, Denver, Salt Lake City), or limited in‑house expertise on schema and content architecture. These scenarios make DIY efforts more error‑prone and slower.\n\nStrategic guidance and clean implementation can dramatically shorten the path to answer placements.\n\nKey triggers to seek help:\n- Confusion about which schema types to use and how\n- Many stakeholders creating content without shared standards\n- High stakes around lead quality and brand reputation\n- Lack of time to audit and maintain Q&A structures regularly\n\nPractically, bring in an expert to design your question map, content framework, and schema templates, then keep ongoing optimization in‑house.\n\nThis “setup plus training” model provides leverage without locking you into endless external dependence.",
