        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/can-aeo-strategy-be-rolled-out-gradually-or-do-i-need-to-rebuild-my-whole-site-a",
        "name": "Can AEO strategy be rolled out gradually, or do I need to rebuild my whole site at once?",
