      "item": {
        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-does-aeo-strategy-actually-help-me-stand-out-from-competitors-who-are-alread",
        "name": "How does AEO strategy actually help me stand out from competitors who are already doing a lot of SEO?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
            ".faq-question",
            ".faq-answer",
            "[itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\"]"
          ]
        },
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "How does AEO strategy actually help me stand out from competitors who are already doing a lot of SEO?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "AEO strategy helps you stand out from competitors by turning your domain into the most structured, trustworthy source of answers on key topics. Instead of competing only on rankings, you compete on being quoted by AI systems, which often highlight only a few names per query.\n\nStrong AEO can quietly shift share of voice even when rankings look similar.\n\nKey differentiators:\n- Cleaner, more concise answers that are easy for machines to extract\n- Richer schema coverage that clearly defines your entities and content\n- Better authority signals: detailed bios, references, reviews, and case studies\n- Coverage of edge‑case and comparison questions competitors ignore\n\nPractically, analyze where competitors are being cited now and target gaps where you can offer clearer, more complete answers.\n\nOver time, this positions you as the default “explainer” in your niche, even if others spend more on traditional SEO.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "AEO lets you compete on being the trusted answer, not just on rankings. By offering clearer question‑based content, better schema, and stronger authority signals, you become the source that AI Overviews and voice assistants quote. This can shift share of voice even when traditional SEO metrics look similar."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "AEO lets you compete on being the trusted answer, not just on rankings. By offering clearer question‑based content, better schema, and stronger authority signal"
      }
    },
    {
