            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "When you’re comparing answer‑engine tools or services, focus less on dashboards and more on how they handle question discovery, schema, and identity consistency across locations like LA and San Diego.\n\nThe best options help you see and shape how AI systems actually talk about you.\n\nKey factors:\n- Quality of question sourcing (search data, PAA, support logs, social, forums).\n- Support for bulk schema management and validation.\n- Features for monitoring AI summaries, citations, and changes over time.\n- Workflows to maintain consistent messaging and entity data across cities.\n\nAsk for concrete examples of how the tool or service improved a brand’s AI descriptions and snippets, and how often they iterate question maps.\nAvoid options that only replicate basic SEO reporting.\n\nChoose solutions that treat answer engines as primary audiences, not just an afterthought to search.",
