              "description": "In Denver and Salt Lake City, strong AEO examples are FAQs about seasonal timing, snow and altitude impacts, service-area coverage for nearby mountain towns, and guides explaining how local climate changes product or service expectations. Each should answer local questions clearly so AI tools can cite your content."
