            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "An answer engine optimization checklist is a structured list of tasks that make your content easy for AI-driven answer engines (like ChatGPT, Google, and voice assistants) to understand, trust, and cite in their responses.\n\nIt typically combines technical SEO, content formatting, and credibility signals so your pages become the \"go-to\" answers for common questions in your niche. A good checklist keeps your team aligned, especially when multiple writers and SEOs are involved.\n\nKey factors:\n- Clarify target questions and intents before creating content\n- Structure pages around question-first headings with direct answers at the top\n- Implement FAQ/HowTo/Article schema correctly\n- Validate crawlability, speed, and mobile usability\n\nStart by documenting your current content, mapping each page to specific questions, and applying checklist items one by one rather than all at once. Revisit and refine the checklist quarterly as answer engines and SERP features evolve. A well-maintained checklist quietly becomes your internal \"playbook\" for AI visibility.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "An answer engine optimization checklist is a structured set of steps to make your content easy for AI answer engines to understand, trust, and cite. It pulls together question research, content formatting, schema markup, and technical checks so your pages can become the preferred answers for high-intent queries."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "An answer engine optimization checklist is a structured set of steps to make your content easy for AI answer engines to understand, trust, and cite. It pulls to"
      }
