              "text": "GEO costs vary widely depending on whether you need a one-time audit, content updates, technical implementation, or ongoing optimization. A simple page-level cleanup is much cheaper than a full site program with schema, content production, and measurement. The best value usually comes from starting with a focused set of high-intent pages rather than trying to optimize everything at once.",
