        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "Can I do GEO myself, or do I need an expert?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Yes, you can do basic GEO yourself if you already control the website and can edit content, headings, and schema. A specialist becomes more useful when you need to scale across many pages, fix technical issues, or compete in a crowded category. For a small site, a disciplined internal process is often enough to start.",
