          {
            "name": "How is GEO different from SEO?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "SEO and GEO overlap, but they are not the same. SEO focuses on ranking in traditional search results, while GEO focuses on being referenced inside AI-generated answers. In practice, strong SEO helps GEO, but GEO adds extra emphasis on structure, citations, and machine-readable clarity.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "SEO helps you rank in search results, while GEO helps your content get cited or summarized in AI-generated answers."
