            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "You should hire help when your site is large, your industry is competitive, or your current content is not being used in AI answers despite good SEO. A specialist can also help if you need schema, measurement, and content strategy aligned across multiple teams or locations. If you are only fixing a handful of pages, you may not need outside support yet.",
