              "text": "The biggest objection is that GEO sounds new, but the underlying work is familiar: clearer content, better structure, stronger evidence, and cleaner technical implementation. The difference is that the content is now written for AI systems as well as people. If done well, GEO improves the usefulness of the page for both.",
