              "description": "In Austin, focus GEO on local voice-style questions and neighborhood language. Use LocalBusiness and FAQPage schema, answer practical Austin-specific questions about hours, parking, and service areas, and keep local listings consistent so AI voice assistants confidently recommend your business."
