        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-do-i-actually-build-a-geo-strategy-step-by-step-if-we-ve-never-done-this-bef",
        "name": "How do I actually build a GEO strategy step by step if we’ve never done this before?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
