        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-does-a-geo-strategy-typically-cost-and-can-we-do-anything-useful-if-our-bud",
        "name": "What does a GEO strategy typically cost, and can we do anything useful if our budget is small?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
