        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-should-i-do-if-ai-answers-keep-getting-details-about-my-brand-wrong-even-af",
        "name": "What should I do if AI answers keep getting details about my brand wrong, even after we update our site?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
