        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/does-geo-strategy-only-apply-to-my-website-or-do-i-need-to-worry-about-third-par",
        "name": "Does GEO strategy only apply to my website, or do I need to worry about third‑party sites too?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
