        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/can-we-realistically-handle-geo-best-practices-ourselves-or-should-we-hire-a-spe",
        "name": "Can we realistically handle GEO best practices ourselves, or should we hire a specialist?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
