        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-should-geo-best-practices-look-for-a-complex-b2b-saas-product-rather-than-si",
        "name": "How should GEO best practices look for a complex B2B SaaS product rather than simple local services?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
