        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/we-re-in-a-tech-heavy-city-like-seattle-or-san-francisco-how-can-geo-best-practi",
        "name": "We’re in a tech‑heavy city like Seattle or San Francisco—how can GEO best practices help us stand out in AI answers?",
