        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-should-a-local-business-in-los-angeles-or-san-diego-approach-generative-ai-s",
        "name": "How should a local business in Los Angeles or San Diego approach generative AI search differently from a national brand?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
