              "description": "You can rank in Google without being AI-friendly. If your pages bury the main answer, lack clear FAQs, tables, or lists, and have weak entity or comparison content, AI assistants may skip you. Retrofit top SEO pages with answer-first sections, structure, and schema to unlock citations."
