              "description": "For fast impact, focus on 5–10 high-value queries. Rewrite those pages with answer-first intros, add realistic FAQs, and implement simple FAQ and Organization schema. Then run weekly AI queries on those topics to detect early citation gains before scaling the approach site-wide."
