              "description": "If ChatGPT still isn’t mentioning you, audit the sources it does cite for your target prompts and compare content depth, structure, and authority. Improve your pages, add FAQ/HowTo schema, and earn backlinks or mentions from similar trusted sites so models have reasons to include you."
