            "name": "What real impact should I expect if my site starts ranking in AI Overviews—more clicks, fewer clicks, or just branding?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Ranking in AI Overviews can boost click‑through for complex questions, brand visibility, and perceived authority, but it may reduce clicks on simple “quick answer” queries. The net outcome depends on your topics and how compelling your snippet is.\n\nWhen your brand appears prominently with a strong, specific answer, users are more likely to trust and choose you. But if the Overview fully satisfies the query, some users won’t click through at all.\n\nKey factors:\n- Query type: simple facts vs nuanced decisions\n- How prominently your brand is cited\n- Whether the Overview teases deeper content\n- Your page’s title and meta description appeal\n\nTarget queries where users naturally need more detail—comparisons, how‑tos, and high‑stakes decisions—so an AI Overview citation becomes a gateway, not the final destination. Craft titles and descriptions that promise clear next steps.\n\nUsed strategically, AI Overviews can become one of your strongest top‑of‑funnel trust accelerators.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "AI Overview citations usually improve brand visibility and trust, and can drive more clicks on complex, high‑intent queries. On simple questions, some users may be satisfied in the Overview. Focus on nuanced topics where the snippet makes people want to read more."
            }
