            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "For most mid-sized companies, AI visibility work ranges from a few thousand dollars in internal time to tens of thousands when using specialized platforms and consulting.\nCosts depend heavily on scope, tooling, and how much content you must overhaul.\n\n**Key factors**\n- **DIY audits:** your team’s time to design prompts, test tools, and analyze results\n- **Platforms:** subscription fees for AI visibility monitoring software\n- **Content and SEO support:** writers, strategists, and technical implementation\n- **Ongoing monitoring:** quarterly or monthly review cycles\n\n**Practical guidance**\nStart with low-cost, manual audits to confirm that AI visibility is a real issue for your brand.\nOnce you see substantial gaps or misrepresentation, budget for a structured program that blends tooling with expert content and technical support.\nFrame costs against the value of being recommended (or omitted) in high-intent buyer journeys.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "AI visibility can be done cheaply with internal audits, but a structured program with platforms and expert support often runs from a few thousand to tens of thousands per year. Cost depends on tooling, content volume, technical work, and how often you monitor and optimize."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "AI visibility can be done cheaply with internal audits, but a structured program with platforms and expert support often runs from a few thousand to tens of tho"
      }
