        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "How can I practically improve my AI visibility without rebuilding my whole website?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "You improve AI visibility by making your content easy for AI models to understand, trust, and quote, and by reinforcing your brand facts across authoritative third‑party sites.\nThis requires both on‑site optimization and off‑site credibility.\n\n**Key factors**\n- Clear, well-structured **content** with self-contained, quotable sentences\n- Strong **FAQ sections** that match common AI-style questions\n- Consistent brand **entity data** across directories, profiles, and publications\n- Fast, crawlable pages with appropriate **schema markup**\n\n**Practical guidance**\nIdentify your top buyer questions and build comprehensive, well-structured answers on your site, then mark them up with FAQ or relevant schema.\nWork to secure mentions on industry directories, review platforms, and thought-leadership sites.\nThe goal is to give AI tools a single, consistent, authoritative picture of who you are and what you do.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "Focus on high-impact pages, not your entire site. Add clear, quotable answers to top buyer questions, build strong FAQ sections with schema markup, fix inconsistent brand facts across the web, and earn mentions on authoritative third‑party sites so AI tools have trustworthy, structured information to cite."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Focus on high-impact pages, not your entire site. Add clear, quotable answers to top buyer questions, build strong FAQ sections with schema markup, fix inconsis"
      }
