        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "How can we improve AI visibility if we have a tight marketing budget?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "For a limited budget, focus on the simplest actions that give AI tools clearer, more trustworthy information without expensive tooling.\nYou can get meaningful gains by tightening content and entity consistency.\n\n**Key factors**\n- Upgrade **one or two core pages** with clear, quotable answers\n- Add compact **FAQ sections** that mirror real buyer questions\n- Clean up inconsistent **profiles and directory listings**\n- Use free or low-cost **prompt testing** for monitoring\n\n**Practical guidance**\nPick your main service or product page and make it the single best place online to understand your offering in 2–3 minutes, then support it with FAQs and schema.\nSystematically fix inconsistent names, descriptions, and links on popular platforms.\nYou can move AI visibility meaningfully before you ever buy software.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "With a tight budget, focus on one or two core pages: make them clear, structured, and rich in FAQ-style answers, then fix inconsistent profiles and listings across major platforms. Use simple manual prompt tests in AI tools to track progress before investing in specialized software."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "With a tight budget, focus on one or two core pages: make them clear, structured, and rich in FAQ-style answers, then fix inconsistent profiles and listings acr"
      }
