            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "If your leadership doesn’t believe AI visibility matters, you’ll need to show concrete examples of missed opportunities and competitive positioning.\nThe goal is to turn abstract hype into specific business risk.\n\n**Key factors**\n- Side‑by‑side **AI answers** where competitors are recommended and you’re absent\n- Examples of **inaccurate or outdated** descriptions of your brand\n- Basic **share-of-voice metrics** across key prompts\n- Anecdotes from sales or support referencing AI tools\n\n**Practical guidance**\nCompile a short internal briefing with screenshots of AI answers to your top buyer questions, highlighting where competitors dominate or narratives are wrong.\nPair that with a simple estimate of potential impact on discovery and leads.\nExecutive support usually follows once they can see the gap in concrete terms.",
              "@type": "Answer",
