            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Most businesses can start AI visibility work without hiring a specialist, but expert support helps once you move beyond basic audits into systematic content and entity optimization.\nIt’s similar to when you outgrow purely DIY SEO.\n\n**Key factors**\n- Internal team’s **comfort** with AI tools, SEO, and analytics\n- Complexity of your **market, products, and buyer questions**\n- Need for **structured schema and data modeling**\n- Desire for ongoing **competitive monitoring**\n\n**Practical guidance**\nBegin with internal audits and simple content improvements; if you struggle to interpret results or implement changes, consider bringing in a specialist or using a platform with strong onboarding.\nUse external help for the heavy lifting while keeping strategic ownership in‑house.\nThat balance preserves institutional knowledge and agility.",
