        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-can-go-wrong-if-i-ignore-ai-visibility-monitoring-and-what-problems-does-it",
        "name": "What can go wrong if I ignore AI visibility monitoring, and what problems does it usually uncover?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
