        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-is-ai-visibility-monitoring-different-from-regular-seo-tracking-and-do-i-sti",
        "name": "How is AI visibility monitoring different from regular SEO tracking, and do I still need both?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
