        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-should-i-do-if-ai-visibility-monitoring-shows-that-chatgpt-or-perplexity-ar",
        "name": "What should I do if AI visibility monitoring shows that ChatGPT or Perplexity are describing my brand incorrectly?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
