        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-do-i-choose-which-prompts-to-use-in-ai-visibility-monitoring-so-the-data-act",
        "name": "How do I choose which prompts to use in AI visibility monitoring so the data actually reflects real customers?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
