        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-exactly-counts-as-a-brand-mention-in-ai-and-how-is-that-different-from-an-a",
        "name": "What exactly counts as a “brand mention” in AI, and how is that different from an AI citation or source link?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
