        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/i-m-new-to-llm-citation-tracking-what-s-the-very-first-thing-i-should-do-to-set",
        "name": "I’m new to LLM citation tracking—what’s the very first thing I should do to set this up?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
