        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/should-i-track-llm-citations-manually-or-invest-in-an-automated-tool-and-when-do",
        "name": "Should I track LLM citations manually or invest in an automated tool, and when does it make sense to switch?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
