        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-often-should-we-be-checking-ai-citations-so-we-don-t-miss-big-changes-but-al",
        "name": "How often should we be checking AI citations so we don’t miss big changes but also don’t drown in busywork?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
