        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/our-brand-was-showing-up-in-ai-answers-and-then-suddenly-disappeared-what-does-t",
        "name": "Our brand was showing up in AI answers and then suddenly disappeared—what does that usually mean and how do we respond?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
