        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/my-ai-citations-keep-changing-month-to-month-is-that-normal-or-a-sign-something",
        "name": "My AI citations keep changing month to month—is that normal or a sign something is wrong?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
