        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-should-i-do-if-ai-engines-suddenly-stop-citing-my-site-and-start-recommendi",
        "name": "What should I do if AI engines suddenly stop citing my site and start recommending competitors instead?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
