              "text": "In tech‑forward cities like Austin and Denver, AI search optimization means treating your brand as part of a rich local ecosystem of events, communities, and industry content—not just a standalone site. AI tools often lean on local thought leadership to decide who to surface.\n\nYou’ll win more visibility if models can see you contributing credible answers, data, and examples tied to those cities.\n\nKey factors:\n- LocalBusiness and Organization schema referencing Austin or Denver\n- Participation in local blogs, meetups, and industry roundups that AI tools cite\n- City‑specific case studies, FAQs, and resource pages\n- Strong, consistent profiles in local directories and chambers or associations\n\nPractically, identify the Austin and Denver sources that appear in AI answers for your niche, then pursue content, sponsorship, or listing opportunities with them.\n\nTreat AI search optimization as partly a local digital PR effort in these markets, not just a technical exercise.",
