        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-are-the-main-risks-of-ai-search-optimization-and-can-i-hurt-my-brand-by-doi",
        "name": "What are the main risks of AI search optimization, and can I hurt my brand by doing it wrong?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
