        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "How does LLMO strategy connect with our AI-driven customer support so messages don’t conflict?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "LLMO strategy can help align AI-driven customer support and marketing by ensuring that the same facts, language, and positioning show up consistently across both. If you ignore this, LLM-based support tools and public AI answers may contradict each other.\n\nA unified approach improves trust and reduces confusion.\n\nKey factors:\n- Shared knowledge sources for internal support bots and public-facing content.\n- Consistent entity definitions, product names, and feature descriptions.\n- Processes for updating both support docs and marketing pages together.\n- Governance for how new information is added to the “source of truth.”\n\nInclude support and success leaders in your LLMO planning, not just marketing. An experienced strategist can help you design a content and entity backbone that feeds both internal LLM use cases and external AI visibility.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "LLMO strategy can align public AI answers and your own support bots by using shared, well-structured content and consistent entity definitions. Plan updates and governance jointly so marketing pages, support docs, and AI systems all pull from the same, synchronized source of truth."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "LLMO strategy can align public AI answers and your own support bots by using shared, well-structured content and consistent entity definitions. Plan updates and"
      }
