        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-should-we-handle-llmo-strategy-if-we-operate-in-multiple-cities-like-la-san",
        "name": "How should we handle LLMO strategy if we operate in multiple cities like LA, San Diego, Austin, Denver, and Salt Lake City?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
