            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Start by reframing your SEO pages into **answer-first, question-led sections** rather than tearing everything down.\n\nTraditional SEO is still essential, but AI-focused formatting and schema make those pages more “quotable” for answer engines.\n\nKey factors:\n- Preserve strong URLs and backlinks; don’t throw them away\n- Update headings to match real questions, not just keywords\n- Add concise answer blocks and FAQ sections near the top\n- Layer FAQPage, HowTo, Article, and Organization schema\n\nIn practice, treat this as an upgrade: keep your SEO wins, but retrofit pages so they look and read like structured Q&A resources.\n\nDone carefully, AI optimization amplifies your existing SEO instead of competing with it.",
