            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "If AI keeps ignoring your content, start by **reverse-engineering the answers that already appear** and comparing them to your pages.\n\nOften the issue is not topic relevance, but structure, evidence, or clarity versus competing sources.\n\nKey factors:\n- How cited sources structure their headings and answer blocks\n- Use of schema, author info, dates, and references\n- Depth and specificity compared to your content\n- Topical focus and lack of conflicting claims\n\nRun your core prompts in multiple AI tools, list the domains they cite, and audit how those pages differ from yours.\n\nThen close the gap by matching their level of clarity and structure while adding your unique insight or local expertise.",
