        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/we-re-a-small-team-how-can-we-realistically-optimize-for-ai-overviews-without-bu",
        "name": "We’re a small team—how can we realistically optimize for AI overviews without burning out?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
