        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-do-i-actually-get-my-website-to-show-up-in-google-ai-overviews-instead-of-ju",
        "name": "How do I actually get my website to show up in Google AI Overviews instead of just regular search results?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
