        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-do-i-figure-out-which-of-my-keywords-actually-trigger-google-ai-overviews-so",
        "name": "How do I figure out which of my keywords actually trigger Google AI Overviews so I know what to optimize first?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
