        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/there-are-so-many-tools-for-schema-and-aeo-how-do-i-pick-the-right-way-to-manage",
        "name": "There are so many tools for schema and AEO. How do I pick the right way to manage structured data?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
