        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-should-i-do-if-i-ve-added-schema-for-ai-search-but-still-don-t-see-my-site",
        "name": "What should I do if I’ve added schema for AI search but still don’t see my site in AI answers or overviews?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
