              "description": "Verify that the questions you target have real search volume, then compare your pages to the current top results for depth, clarity, and structure. Fix on‑page basics, consolidate thin content, and consider pivoting to adjacent or better‑phrased questions if demand or intent doesn’t match your current answers."
