              "description": "Use more specific local context in your questions and answers—neighborhoods, landmarks, parking, hours, and traffic realities. Los Angeles and San Diego users often search by voice on mobile, so prioritize concise, mobile‑friendly, answer‑first content tied closely to real local scenarios."
