        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-should-i-check-if-my-zero-click-visibility-doesn-t-seem-to-be-improving-at",
        "name": "What should I check if my zero-click visibility doesn’t seem to be improving at all?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
          "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
          "cssSelector": [
            "h1",
