        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-do-ai-platforms-like-chatgpt-or-perplexity-fit-into-a-zero-click-visibility",
        "name": "How do AI platforms like ChatGPT or Perplexity fit into a zero-click visibility strategy?",
