              "description": "Optimize for AI Overviews by structuring each page around a specific question, leading with a 40–80 word direct answer in the first 100–200 words, and adding FAQ/HowTo schema. Keep pages fast, mobile-friendly, and backed by strong expertise so Google can easily extract and trust your answer."
