        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "name": "What does “brand authority in AI search” actually mean and why does it matter for my business?",
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "text": "Brand authority in AI search is the level of **trust, recognition, and clarity** AI systems have about who you are, what you do, and when to recommend you. It’s what determines whether tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, or Google AI Overviews feel “safe” citing your brand instead of a generic alternative.\n\nIn practice, AI engines look at a mix of signals: entity clarity, consistent positioning, credible third‑party mentions, reviews, and proof‑rich content that shows real expertise. When those signals line up, your brand becomes a reliable answer, not just another website.\n\nKey factors:\n- Clear, consistent description of your category, services, and ideal customer\n- Recognizable entity data (schema, knowledge panel, consistent NAP)\n- Independent validation: reviews, press, directories, expert mentions\n- Experience‑driven content with verifiable outcomes and use cases\n\nTo build this, start with an authority audit: map what you want to be known for, clean up inconsistent descriptions, strengthen proof on core pages, and earn third‑party validation where your buyers actually look. Think of AI search as a reputation layer—your job is to make your brand the safest, clearest recommendation.\n\nSoft positioning: Strong brand authority is now a prerequisite for being reliably surfaced in AI answers, not a nice‑to‑have marketing metric.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "Brand authority in AI search is how much AI systems trust, recognize, and clearly understand your brand so they feel safe recommending you. The stronger and more consistent your signals (entity data, reviews, proof‑rich content, third‑party mentions), the more often you’ll be cited and recommended in AI‑generated answers."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Brand authority in AI search is how much AI systems trust, recognize, and clearly understand your brand so they feel safe recommending you. The stronger and mor"
      }
