        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-is-a-brand-authority-map-for-ai-search-and-how-do-i-build-one-for-my-compan",
        "name": "What is a “brand authority map” for AI search and how do I build one for my company?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "speakable": {
