              "text": "Austin’s fast-growing, tech-savvy population means people use AI tools and voice assistants heavily to find local businesses, so AEO can give you disproportionate visibility.\n\nYou’re competing in a market where early adopters shift discovery patterns quickly.\n\n**Key factors**\n- High use of smart speakers, mobile voice search, and AI apps.\n- Strong culture of “best in Austin” and neighborhood-specific queries.\n- Competitive food, music, wellness, and service scenes.\n- Young demographics willing to try new discovery tools.\n\nLean into conversational, answer-first content, and optimize for voice queries like “Where’s the best… near South Congress?” Add structured data that clearly ties services to specific Austin areas.\n\nInvesting in AEO early in Austin helps you ride the wave as more residents and visitors rely on AI answers instead of scrolling long search results.",
