        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/what-are-the-real-risks-of-ignoring-voice-search-and-aeo-or-doing-it-wrong",
        "name": "What are the real risks of ignoring voice search and AEO, or doing it wrong?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
