        "url": "aeoptimizer.com/faq/how-should-i-prioritize-speakable-schema-if-my-budget-and-dev-resources-are-limi",
        "name": "How should I prioritize speakable schema if my budget and dev resources are limited?",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
