              "text": "You can start with a few high-value questions that customers already ask on calls or in messages. Turn each into a concise answer page and keep the language direct, factual, and local where relevant. This is especially useful for service businesses in San Diego, Austin, or Denver that need quick voice-friendly answers.",
              "@type": "Answer",
              "description": "Publish one clear, factual FAQ page that answers the exact questions customers ask most often."
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Publish one clear, factual FAQ page that answers the exact questions customers ask most often."
      }
